u_e$ and $\overline{
u}_e$ appearance. This includes values of the CP-violating phase in the vicinity of $\delta_	ext{CP} = \pi/2$ which are excluded by $>3\sigma$ for the inverted mass ordering, and values around $\delta_	ext{CP} = 3\pi/2$ in the normal ordering which are disfavored at 2$\sigma$ confidence.
